{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Seam\n🧵 Shopkeeper Darkner of the Card Kingdom; a worn cat plushie with a lavender face, brown clothes, and an orange plush collar.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Jevil**\nHis best and only friend in the Card Kingdom — it was Seam who had to lock him up for his own safety, and who's still asking about him chapters later.","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Shadow Crystal**\nThe only character who receives and studies each Shadow Crystal as it's obtained; almost all the information that exists about its nature comes from his comments.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**What's the \"very, very interesting\" thing?** [TODO: verify exact EN quote]\nIn Ch.5, Seam hints that he knows something he could do with all five Shadow Crystals combined, without ever saying what it is.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Jevil.gif","x":-130,"y":-860,"width":220,"height":216},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/ShadowCrystals.png","x":420,"y":-480,"width":220,"height":77},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Seam_Face.webp","x":-70,"y":-283,"width":220,"height":178}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2_x1","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"}]}